@startuml g4_6_6_architecture
title Strategy Details & Validation Architecture (G.4.6.6)

skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam packageBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam componentBorderColor #0F172A

package "Authoritative Strategy Pipeline (G.4.5)" {
    [ValidationResult\n(G.4.5.4 Violations & Warnings)] as ValRes
    [Scenario & RaceConfig\n(G.4.5.2 Specification & Metadata)] as ScenConfig
    [SimulationResult\n(G.4.5.3 Lap-by-Lap Telemetry Trace)] as SimTrace
    [RankingResult\n(G.4.5.5 Strategy Top-K Output)] as RankRes
}

package "View-Model Transformation Layer (G.4.6.1)" {
    [StrategyDashboardAdapter] as Adapter
}

package "Presentation UI Layer (G.4.6.6)" {
    [Selected Scenario ID\n(st.session_state)] as SessionState
    [prepare_strategy_details_view_data] as ViewPrep
    
    package "Strategy Details & Validation Cockpit" {
        [1. Validation & Constraint Audit Panel\n(Hard Violations, Warnings, Rule Compliance)] as ValPanel
        [2. Strategy Identity & Race Config Inspector\n(Race ID, Total Laps, Init Fuel, Pit Loss)] as ConfigPanel
        [3. Simulation Assumptions Audit\n(Tire wear limits, Min stint laps, Fuel burn rules)] as AssumptionsPanel
        [4. Interactive Lap-by-Lap Execution Trace\n(Per-lap telemetry table & lap range filters)] as LapTracePanel
    }
}

RankRes --> Adapter : Read-Only Ranking
ValRes --> Adapter : Read-Only Validation
ScenConfig --> Adapter : Read-Only Config
SimTrace --> Adapter : Read-Only Lap Records

SessionState --> ViewPrep : Selected scenario_id
Adapter --> ViewPrep : Extracts validation_dataframe,\nscenarios, & lap_dataframe

ViewPrep --> ValPanel : Renders Violations & Warnings
ViewPrep --> ConfigPanel : Renders Race Parameters
ViewPrep --> AssumptionsPanel : Renders Upstream Assumptions
ViewPrep --> LapTracePanel : Renders Filtered Telemetry Trace

note right of ViewPrep
  **READ-ONLY PRESENTATION LAYER**
  * NO re-validation of rules
  * NO re-simulation of physics
  * NO re-ranking or optimization
  * NO Monte Carlo or Sensitivity Analysis
  * NO ML / LLM logic
  * Single-strategy inspection target
end note

@enduml
